    "detailed_description": "\u3010Game Features\u3011<br />\r\nOnly American style, martial arts masters gather, and various factions are constantly fighting! This is a multiplayer tabletop card game with Chinese style characteristics!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeautiful deck, simple and easy to use. Pair it with a powerful strategic combination to start a fierce 3v3 duel!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnique martial arts, with inherent talent. The protagonist knights in the game each have their own unique skills, and each protagonist has unique martial arts and talents! .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMatch 3V3 and play quickly. You come from different places and enter into a magical 3V3 game. Each game is not long but extremely interesting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt\u2019s endless fun to form a team and make friends. The first happiness on the table is to bring two or three friends and drink four or five taels of fine wine. &quot;Sword Fight&quot; is such a martial arts world, a simple and happy game, and encounters in the rivers and lakes are all fate.",
